The '''Sorgan Common House''',<ref name="Databank">{{Databank|sorgan-common-house|Sorgan Common House}}</ref> also known as the '''Sorgan public house''', was located on the [[planet]] [[Sorgan]], run by<ref name="Mandalorian4" /> [[Dara Vish]].<ref name="Handbook">''[[Star Wars: The Mandalorian Handbook]]''</ref> The house had multiple tables and chairs for seating guests and a grill. It also served food, including [[bone broth]] and [[spotchka]].<ref name="Mandalorian4" />

